            <ArticleTitle>Audit of complications in post-operative epidural analgesia and adherence to acute pain service protocols at an Indian cancer center.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/15360288.2012.753974</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An audit of epidural anesthesia in an Indian teaching hospital is described. The authors reviewed Acute Pain Service (APS) documentation of epidural anesthesia and outcomes form the procedure over a 6-month period. Variances from established protocols were noted and reasons for these variances are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
